{
  "_doc": [
    "The coverage skeleton (Aug 26, 2026 — the MaRo design-skeleton import):",
    "mechanic -> its designated live vehicle (deck, card). The pin",
    "(tests/test_coverage_skeleton.py) asserts each slot's card (a) exists",
    "in the named deck JSON, (b) is in data/card_data_cache.json, and (c)",
    "where check is set, the mechanic's parser/classifier recognizes it.",
    "This converts the Aug-9 seeding sweep into a standing invariant: a",
    "deck edit that removes a mechanic's only vehicle now fails a test",
    "instead of surfacing four audit cycles later (the Shard Volley",
    "near-miss). Editing a deck? Either keep the slot's card, or move the",
    "slot to the new vehicle IN THE SAME COMMIT.",
    "check vocabulary: 'parse_*' = a mtg.helpers parser must accept the",
    "card's cache oracle; 'text:<sig>' = signature in oracle (lowercase);",
    "'tier15' = the template library classifies it template/pattern;",
    "'adventure_faces'/'transform_layout' = cache-entry structure; null =",
    "membership+cache only.",
    "Fork note: deck filenames are mapped to this repo's names (surrak_stompy / mythic_sanity / mythic_madness)."
  ],
